{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24871","headline":"送陈房谒抚州周使君 · 杨衡","name":"送陈房谒抚州周使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"匡山一亩宫，尚有桂兰丛。\n凿壁年虽异，穿杨志幸同。\n貌羸缘塞苦，道蹇爲囊空。\n去谒临川守，因怜鹤在笼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}